40. HEAP VS SET
------------------------------------------------------------

A common question:

    "Why not just use set?"


set:

    - Keeps everything sorted
    - O(log N) insertion
    - O(log N) deletion


heap:

    - Gives min/max quickly
    - O(log N) push
    - O(log N) pop
    - O(1) top


If you only care about:

    minimum / maximum

heap is often simpler and faster.



